Local adaptations: retained SuperMimic Gym's CPU MuJoCo environment and
runner; added task presets, actor/configuration validation and legacy
checkpoint handling; cached action bounds without changing state_dict keys;
added gradient diagnostics and per-clip smoothness metrics with pre-reset
velocities and valid-sample weighting. No PPO or mjlab runtime was imported.

The 29 bounds use the upstream G1 joint order, checked against mjlab revision
8bb2bc9e187797689ec82c78c35019afd2fd0376, asset_zoo/robots/unitree_g1/xmls/g1.xml.
Its g1_constants.py uses the same motor inertias, gains and normalized action
scale (0.25 * effort_limit / stiffness) as this task. Bounds are empirical
training defaults, not physical joint limits or a guarantee of convergence.
